; Files and folders that older Lotus versions installed and the compact package (1.2.2+) no longer ships:
; unused Windows App SDK parts (AI, ML, Widgets, Search), debug files and framework texts in other languages.
; Only these exact names inside {app} are removed on update; nothing else (player data lives in %LOCALAPPDATA%\Lotus).
